From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:45:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 091/144] GreatDANE: per-binary macOS entitlements; no browser
 entitlements on helpers; Dane signing map + tool

Fixes the Oct 29 sweep finding: every helper carried the full browser set (DLV, allow-jit,
camera/mic/usb/location/smartcard), because the out-of-tree signing step signed helpers with
`--entitlements <browser set> --deep`.

- security/mac/hardenedruntime/production/dane.browser.xml: firefox.browser.xml minus
  com.apple.application-identifier and com.apple.developer.web-browser.public-key-credential
  (they wait for Apple's grant). Keeps disable-library-validation, Mozilla's "Allow loading third
  party libraries to support pkcs11 modules": ESR loads PKCS#11 modules in the parent
  (security-module-helper is NIGHTLY_BUILD-only).
- dane.browser.no-dlv.xml: stricter alternative without DLV (breaks third-party PKCS#11 modules).
- media-plugin-helper.app keeps Mozilla's media-plugin-helper.xml (DLV only, "Allow loading third
  party CDM libraries"). The GMP process loads Widevine/OpenH264 there
  (GeckoChildProcessHost.cpp, media.plugin_helper_process.enabled=true).
- plugin-container.app keeps plugin-container.xml (allow-jit only).
- gpu-helper, updater.app, UpdateSettings.framework, the LaunchServices updater and dmgInstallHelper,
  crashreporter, crashhelper, pingsender, nmhproxy, XUL, dylibs, ChannelPrefs and greatdane-node*:
  no entitlements (hardened runtime defaults), the same as Mozilla production.
- greatdane/macos/sign-map.tsv + greatdane/tools/sign_dane_macos.py (plan/sign/check): inside-out,
  --timestamp --options runtime, never --deep for signing. Refuses unmapped Mach-O, restricted
  entitlements without embedded.provisionprofile, and the owner's /Volumes/Dane and DaneNotarized paths.
- taskcluster/config.yml mac-signing: Dane LaunchServices names, greatdane-node*, dane.browser.xml.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
